<!-- SREP 29 s2 @hue (degrees), @brightness and the window edge. Effect e: @hue=120, @brightness=-0.2: green #00B400 (V=0.7059, w=1) gives V'=0.5059: (0,129,0); yellow #B4B400 (hue 60, d=0.1667 > 0.15, w=0) is unchanged. Effect e2: @hue=30, @saturation=0: #87B400 has hue 75 degrees, d=0.125 turn, w = 1 - smoothstep(0.1, 0.15, 0.125) = 0.5 (the midpoint of the smoothstep), S' = 1*(1+(0-1)*0.5) = 0.5, V=180/255: (157.5,180,90); #B45A00 (hue 30, w=1) gives (180,180,180). Engine provenance: measured on rs-scene-render vendor/schema-1.3 build 2d9eb13d (binary sha256 prefix 4be4bebe002bc190), llvmpipe, frame 0 (render -f 0), VM style1; the expected values were derived from the SREP formulas first (script model) and then compared with the render. Proposals until re-verified on the vendoring commit. -->
<scene version="1.2">
<project width="640" height="360" fps="24" duration="1" background="#000000FF"/>
<output id="still" path="out/frame_%04d.png" codec="png-sequence"/>
<materials><material id="m-red" baseColor="#FF0000FF" unlit="true" doubleSided="true"/><material id="m-green" baseColor="#00FF00FF" unlit="true" doubleSided="true"/><material id="m-blue" baseColor="#0000FFFF" unlit="true" doubleSided="true"/><material id="m-yellow" baseColor="#FFFF00FF" unlit="true" doubleSided="true"/></materials>
<composition>
<shape id="b0" shape="rect" width="80" height="80" x="40" y="100" fill="#00B400FF" effects="e"/>
<shape id="b1" shape="rect" width="80" height="80" x="160" y="100" fill="#B4B400FF" effects="e"/>
<shape id="b2" shape="rect" width="80" height="80" x="280" y="100" fill="#87B400FF" effects="e2"/>
<shape id="b3" shape="rect" width="80" height="80" x="400" y="100" fill="#B45A00FF" effects="e2"/>
</composition>
<effects>
<effect id="e" type="selective-color" hue="120" brightness="-0.2"/>
<effect id="e2" type="selective-color" hue="30" saturation="0"/>
</effects>
</scene>
